    "step": {
      "init": {
        "title": "Weheat Portal Authentication (Write Access)",
        "description": "The standard Home Assistant OAuth client (`HomeAssistantAPI`) only provides read access to `/third_party/api/v1/*`. To enable portal settings and write controls (quiet mode, silent schedule, DHW target temperature, Legionella prevention), enter your Weheat Portal email & password (for automatic PKCE token refresh) OR paste a session JSON / Bearer token from `https://portal.weheat.nl/api/auth/session`.",
